<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Wi-Fi FGTECH</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #001f3f, #004080);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100vh;
    }
    .container {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 400px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-size: 26px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    input[type="text"], input[type="tel"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      outline: none;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    label {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #ddd;
    }
    button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      background-color: #007bff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover {
      background-color: #0056b3;
    }
    .success {
      display: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #00ff9d;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Wi-Fi FGTECH</h1>
    <p>Conecte-se à internet de forma rápida e segura.<br>Preencha seus dados para liberar o acesso.</p>
    
    <form id="leadForm" action="https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwO1kt0w84fmHNRlrV_gv5oMlIJlhIfnwLNr4A04fx3XvJlCi6hNUIUVFx2x9DddUdV2g/exec" method="POST">
      <input type="text" name="nome" placeholder="Seu nome" required />
      <input type="tel" name="telefone" placeholder="Seu telefone" required />
      <div style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label>
          <input type="checkbox" required />
          Li e aceito os <a href="#" style="color: #00aaff;">termos de uso</a>.
        </label>
      </div>
      <button type="submit">Conectar</button>
    </form>
    
    <div class="success" id="successMsg">
      ✅ Acesso liberado! Aproveite sua conexão.
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const form = document.getElementById("leadForm");
    const successMsg = document.getElementById("successMsg");

    form.addEventListener("submit", async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const data = new FormData(form);
      try {
        await fetch(form.action, { method: "POST", body: data });
        form.style.display = "none";
        successMsg.style.display = "block";
        setTimeout(() => window.location.href = "http://neverssl.com", 3000);
      } catch {
        alert("Ocorreu um erro. Tente novamente.");
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
